            <div xml:id="m-0f411500-c123-4085-bc85-5fe12400dd88">
              <lg xml:id="m-dd0c9c43-5acb-496e-893f-5bbd0ad56e40">
                <l xml:id="m-b4013f14-af17-4080-b23e-0193b6dd48ee" facs="#m-3fe189b1-39fe-4fa3-9301-c255b2a7e040" label="ambiguous">806</l><l xml:id="m-de5719a7-1f96-4921-acb3-91c18125ae11" facs="#m-d95558c8-3603-4ae2-a0bb-faad2a94f8dc" label="ambiguous">Saturday in Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-093d7c1e-03ac-456c-9852-beab99fb4186" facs="#m-46a15022-0f71-424e-bcf0-06f28e5300ab" label="lyrics-like">laudá¬</l><l xml:id="m-884ff01d-8e28-4350-9220-da5282a6ca60" facs="#m-9d3cd2ef-cb87-45bb-84b5-da9e4d5f66c0" label="ambiguous">te</l><l xml:id="m-e504bee4-b8c9-4dc5-a0ba-2374d1f1e698" facs="#m-41d0edd0-9fb3-4faf-9dca-f33a6fc4a0ef" label="lyrics-like">pú- e-ri Dóminum,</l><l xml:id="m-62211a24-ef2e-4aa9-8871-bec08ce28909" facs="#m-fb9dd351-b52b-48a9-892c-216b0d0cd906" label="lyrics-like">te nómen “Dómi¬ ni.</l><l xml:id="m-d2f18fc3-6475-4cdf-82e8-2c47400ad79a" facs="#m-aa05c4b6-304d-4b4c-8281-08ed03257324" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia- is not repeated, but the Sequence. Victimae Pascháli. 1s next</l><l xml:id="m-3988989b-2f82-478b-a13f-6d3539d767b0" facs="#m-c40941e0-0fbf-44c7-9a17-b40951370a80" label="lyrics-like">sung, with Allelúia. at the end, 780.</l><l xml:id="m-e2b3fdf6-1fb1-4c41-b99a-920e888ea2cc" facs="#m-ceebfed7-7218-420a-940c-1e6fbf626089" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Joannem. Joann. 20.</l><l xml:id="m-b1547e4f-b66d-4cd3-b4f3-e2c96af7be9b" facs="#m-c41ce08a-7381-410e-afc6-f0626ece744b" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Una sábbati, ] méntum. Et cum se inclinásset,</l><l xml:id="m-07a55736-5813-440f-ac79-1746ca0eb301" facs="#m-6a358e05-724f-4f90-9efa-d1458fa729e8" label="lyrics-like">L Maria Magdaléne venit mane,</l><l xml:id="m-c059b6b1-497a-4eb1-ae89-67bf92ca3571" facs="#m-3cac5c4e-2b64-406a-9692-819b50340e4a" label="lyrics-like">vidit pósita linteámina, non tamen</l><l xml:id="m-0c803711-fddb-46c8-a33a-f951deb5fb8d" facs="#m-3f5c8396-cde0-4af1-8ae7-cac326e5e691" label="lyrics-like">cum adhuc ténebrae essent, ad</l><l xml:id="m-d15669b1-1379-4107-b3c2-5e6464bea8b3" facs="#m-441bf03a-9bd1-46ee-b9eb-f7b81a68bbde" label="ambiguous">introivit. Venit ergo Simon Petrus</l><l xml:id="m-d1b50268-0bb0-4384-8f49-316aacc72a13" facs="#m-ee632895-6e30-4386-964a-444518f50531" label="lyrics-like">monuméntum: et vidit lápidem</l><l xml:id="m-eb66a77d-72ec-4175-850e-2c376955c151" facs="#m-2fc0bc79-4258-45d5-a96a-3a4694cdcef6" label="ambiguous">sequens eum, et introivit in monu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b01459b-dee6-4863-b6b2-8d86a2788924" facs="#m-33a16d8c-5258-473d-ace9-6127dac5b2c2" label="lyrics-like">sublátum a monuménto. Cucúrrit</l><l xml:id="m-5182ebcd-1a6f-42ef-82fb-af012b94185f" facs="#m-f2348e69-aa1b-43a4-9890-d814d96ef5c1" label="lyrics-like">méntum, et vidit linteámina pósita,</l><l xml:id="m-ae31311a-27a8-49e8-85d2-95c7d07378b5" facs="#m-67df74c3-8527-4310-a35f-0f10255f2b65" label="lyrics-like">ergo, et venit ad Simónem Petrum.</l><l xml:id="m-e7f141f7-7a8c-4661-9e43-587a0b713255" facs="#m-f38c097c-c3f6-4216-877d-29ba07f98c20" label="lyrics-like">et sudárium, quod fúerat super</l><l xml:id="m-39b5afd4-6f94-41d6-8d0a-2cb5b720844b" facs="#m-f63050a4-d8b1-4d47-9e44-6471586dfbba" label="lyrics-like">et ad álium discipulum, quem</l><l xml:id="m-c1bbc0cd-8ad2-4ca6-bc23-4b6a668fee1e" facs="#m-9e2f38e6-5694-4da4-8aea-ce137bf9de91" label="ambiguous">caput ejus, non cum linteaminibus</l><l xml:id="m-70699693-56d2-4eed-bc5c-b6c9ed710a8e" facs="#m-89b6752c-69f4-482c-ab5f-59556038a15a" label="lyrics-like">amábat Jesus, et dicit illis: Tulé¬</l><l xml:id="m-538aaa8f-8729-457b-be7f-9840a7116173" facs="#m-a4a88525-9734-42c2-9dc1-309c35d6674a" label="lyrics-like">pósitum, sed separátim involútum</l><l xml:id="m-867dd04f-a730-4de5-8944-f69e4b6e59f5" facs="#m-de323972-76eb-4d8c-aa5c-f3064b39c61c" label="lyrics-like">runt Dóminum de monuménto, et</l><l xml:id="m-0d759a87-897b-4e23-a497-07f4df9c375d" facs="#m-f7f48c4d-5980-4699-a6de-85aefb9d3c0e" label="ambiguous">in unum locum. Tunc ergo introivit</l><l xml:id="m-9f1c5622-5227-4efd-91d0-f6e4cedd4491" facs="#m-ecf9158c-5c02-4126-b0d4-34644d784fea" label="lyrics-like">nescímus ubi posuérunt eum. Exiit</l><l xml:id="m-969ed344-404f-4677-901d-cfe4cb6bf6bd" facs="#m-6f24dec6-da13-4fcc-bb9d-e439ae89d9ee" label="lyrics-like">et ille discipulus, qui vénerat primus</l><l xml:id="m-1db88939-1dbe-438c-82fb-d7674c548731" facs="#m-b2f33577-046b-4f06-bd86-b7be4670e1fa" label="lyrics-like">ergo Petrus, et ille álius discipulus</l><l xml:id="m-3476b8e3-c8b1-44f0-aec1-7b8fa2630574" facs="#m-2973a80c-42c3-40bd-bb36-bd667f156f8e" label="lyrics-like">ad monuméntum: et vidit, et cré¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac77c833-9df3-4027-90db-86dbf9bbb885" facs="#m-b35237fb-71a4-4669-9f30-decb7ac20475" label="lyrics-like">et venérunt ad monuméntum. Cur¬</l><l xml:id="m-27a477bb-b3cc-4889-ad71-b00406e9c2dc" facs="#m-b2f955c2-b2d4-476e-bfd6-6ff6be89cc09" label="lyrics-like">didit : nondum enim sciébant Scri¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b9856e7-a823-4094-a456-3590ef58058d" facs="#m-c5172fab-3b80-4546-9316-64720006c09e" label="lyrics-like">rébant autem duo simul, et ille</l><l xml:id="m-2b24f1f9-d3dc-4b1c-8322-f2700b57af22" facs="#m-a420ef6b-1e0c-4d18-ab07-0d31b06ae201" label="lyrics-like">ptúram, quia oportébat eum a</l><l xml:id="m-9886da47-334a-4d22-9d45-8819f2c002ff" facs="#m-82a7e144-cb21-4135-aad5-ce6f1e954301" label="lyrics-like">alius discipulus praecucúrrit citius</l><l xml:id="m-0067b833-917a-4460-be5e-0532f5c968cc" facs="#m-1583b2f2-9328-4995-9b8f-38d7b63cfb8e" label="lyrics-like">mórtuis resúrgere.</l><l xml:id="m-6eb198ff-01af-44e6-87ae-86d7cd87a9a2" facs="#m-a68e7caa-de48-4281-9e3d-1069f05d4f11" label="ambiguous">Credo</l><l xml:id="m-baae99b3-7fed-4038-a8a5-95cc52b3822f" facs="#m-db44e6b0-9586-49f2-9637-0af7ae75d82a" label="ambiguous">Petro, et venit primus ad monu¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb0059e4-96d6-4f06-bc69-b36911d2950e" facs="#m-eaece1df-8574-48b3-83df-65ed3506af48" label="ambiguous">orrert.E</l><l xml:id="m-057a3fcb-902b-4219-b192-5bb3b899de92" facs="#m-52aff3ce-6092-463a-814f-3481ed4f1e56" label="lyrics-like">E- nedí- ctus“ qui vé¬ nit</l><l xml:id="m-4393c027-d4e3-4770-aa34-e89f51d53b62" facs="#m-edec6e9d-9c70-435e-a2f6-cbeea369d217" label="lyrics-like">in nó-mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-51874f2f-3fd2-4fbd-96e6-75fa5c5b8054" facs="#m-c18167aa-7a3c-45cd-a073-41001f3a7b84" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi-ni:</l><l xml:id="m-9291e5f1-fee3-4b1c-bc5c-e2d67fad2a12" facs="#m-8d5100bf-69c8-415a-9837-9dd0c60a08f3" label="lyrics-like">benedí-ximus</l><l xml:id="m-433bf452-7a5d-4205-9459-ddf4cedbd10d" facs="#m-04daa6e6-9219-4f3d-9736-1d8c5df5bf79" label="lyrics-like">vóbis</l><l xml:id="m-8774cd1a-e50d-4e1a-839e-bad44a7401ea" facs="#m-dc512235-febe-4340-a6f8-65bd73bcd160" label="ambiguous">ne</l><l xml:id="m-9fa178f2-9dec-4922-b24e-06ed02912035" facs="#m-5cb07f57-dfab-494e-b55b-1b49c0499c4d" label="ambiguous">L.</l><l xml:id="m-a4717b3a-2cc1-46c6-89f5-01563b884eb9" facs="#m-4cc951f5-f651-439c-9b20-3823dba89a3b" label="lyrics-like">de dómo Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-892c5120-ba4e-40d9-ab77-32568808964a" facs="#m-6af462dd-e229-44e8-8223-dd442f1a8df2" label="lyrics-like">ni : Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-823d8e41-d1a8-4f84-93f2-10ef33d5caff" facs="#m-2ead2ced-c3ad-451e-9815-427b587688ef" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d168d7a-febc-4861-923f-06cce0108b70" facs="#m-55b79f69-e32b-469d-ac7d-e96ed4e55680" label="ambiguous">mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c2636331-9f8e-4745-b806-ad128378b90a" facs="#m-29a5a0ac-0c27-4fc7-bf86-b59ff49e1bd1" label="ambiguous">us</l><l xml:id="m-eecd2cc9-01ad-428b-b85b-2bf6816179c1" facs="#m-54e9b88e-13f0-49ff-873b-f6f134255e99" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-32ae8d7d-2553-4e9b-99ac-d31c7e629e53" facs="#m-f920f72b-4488-45ad-b502-7eb20ef254e0" label="ambiguous">bis,</l><l xml:id="m-c44b3541-c359-4e2b-ac72-9392a61c323b" facs="#m-64f2a93c-ae5f-498e-9f25-b974bf54f375" label="ambiguous">mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c077831-1ef3-4168-b6cf-5277ed708cad" facs="#m-41d0c455-8cdd-47a5-82fc-6fff57f290d2" label="lyrics-like">et illú-xit nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-47c6e542-6455-4e87-8189-4508b5e5653d" facs="#m-3dbc5dcf-fcb3-408d-9d3a-5535bd04ced3" label="ambiguous">nus,</l></lg>
            </div>
